{"summary":"Take a challenge and dive into American Sniper 3D, a pulse pounding gun game","description":"🎮 Dive into the intense world of \"American Sniper 3D\" – a gripping third-person shooter that puts you in the shoes of a skilled sniper on a mission to rescue the USA from terrorists! Your journey begins in California, but as you progress through each level, state by state, you'll face thrilling challenges to eliminate targets and save hostages. 🌎\n\n🔫 With simple controls – hold to aim and release to shoot – you'll navigate various locations, showcasing your sniper prowess. Unlock a vast arsenal of weapons and customize them with different attachments. Choose from a variety of character skins, each with unique abilities. 🌟\n\n💰 Complete daily missions within 24 hours to earn bonus money, enhancing your arsenal and boosting your skills. Immerse yourself in the action-packed gameplay, strategize your moves, and prove you have what it takes to be the ultimate American Sniper! 🇺🇸\n\n👉 Key Features:\n\nEngaging Third-Person Shooter Gameplay\nDynamic Levels Across Iconic US States\nUnlockable Weapons and Attachments\nDiverse Character Skins with Unique Abilities\nDaily Missions for Bonus Rewards\nIntuitive Controls for Precision Shooting\nImmerse Yourself in a Patriotic Rescue Mission\n🔥 Embark on this thrilling adventure, experience the adrenaline-pumping sniper action, and become the hero America needs! 🎯","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Strong Violence","iapPrices":"$0.99 - $9.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/qjsTdKOpc3c?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fKypHBzv4cYAfFHyYmI2wvhz57-gyWggXsoAedA5JI3kuj0TSnr33Pxtc0R5FW8X2pH-_wONmruLTkOEY99HeQ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7wmnaCz3YDPYTYplu6wnUt_vvuty7Y0apkeQHxmnAsrRu5w_BEsKZdCghijPwUzNqqiZ_twNTzmZm5EF7pLBbA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/i0v7b2FpQk8bkrpbBgRoVlEWG1YChPoMpc7wALGJXTX2ZI-6cT9bjKYcc4JXfQbUNW